      "normalize": [
        "trim"
      ],
      "combine": "union",
      "note": "#690 (29): the graph writes nestedCriticalAdGroups as a DICTIONARY { type, data: [ JSON text {groupUniqueId, groupName} ] } -- [*] over it walked the dictionary's own values (its type name and the whole list), never the groups. data[*].groupName reads each group's name; the second source keeps a plain list of groups readable."
    },
    {
